    { "id": "cicd",     "type": "backend",   "label": "CI/CD 流水线","sublabel": "Git Push → 构建 → 部署","stage": 4, "row": 1, "tag": "自动化" },
    { "id": "monitor",  "type": "backend",   "label": "监控告警", "sublabel": "Prometheus + Grafana","stage": 4, "row": 3, "tag": "可观测" }
